.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-utils 1  "utils " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-utils \- Utility helpers
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc utils\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Utility helpers
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mdmc\-utils\-hash(1)
Print the snapshot\-naming digest of a Message\-ID
